            </p>
            <p>
                <DisplayEquation equation="\\tau = \\frac{P c}{\\omega J}\\" title="Maximum shear stress:"/>
            </p>
	<em>Note:</em>  1 hp = 550 ft.lb/s
    </CalloutCard>
